  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development to which this permission relates must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of the decision notice. \rReason: To comply with the provisions of S.51 of the Planning & Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.\r",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the approved plans,\r\t\rLocation Plan \rBlock Plan A101\rA102 Rev A\rA103 Rev A\rA104 Rev A\rA105 Rev A\rA106 Rev A\rA107 \rA108 Rev A\rA109 \r \rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "The materials shall match those used in the construction of the existing building unless otherwise specified within the submitted plans. \r\rReason: To ensure a satisfactory appearance.\r",
    "No part of the flat roof shall be used for any recreational purpose and shall be used for the access of the upper floor flats only and means of emergency escape. \r\rReason: To prevent unacceptable noise and disturbance and to safeguard the privacy of the occupiers of adjoining properties.\r",
    "The privacy screening as shown on submitted plan number A108 Rev A shall be installed in accordance with the details approved and shall be maintained in perpetuity.\r\rReason: To safeguard the privacy of the occupiers of the adjoining neighbour.\r\r\r"
  ],
